  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "If a required configuration option is missing (encountered by running the webapp in tomcat without a fcrepo.modeshape.configuration), then the logs give a large error message which references the 4.x documentation. This is coming from FedoraContextLoaderListener. It should reference the 5.x docs.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
